{"title": "The Absolute's Mercy", "pageid": 28500, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Absolute's_Mercy", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Absolute's Mercy</b> is a passive feature that makes the wearer more likely to survive being unconscious.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If the wearer bears the <a href=\"/wiki/Brand_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Brand of the Absolute\">Absolute's Brand</a>, they have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Death Saving Throw\">Death Saving Throws</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Talisman\" title=\"Absolute's Talisman\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Absolute%27s_Talisman_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Talisman\" title=\"Absolute's Talisman\">Absolute's Talisman</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gut\" title=\"Gut\">Gut</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202521\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1012/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8386/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2106/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 112/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754716/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.452      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   35.452      1 -total\n 31.47%   11.158      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 28.70%   10.176      1 Template:Advantage\n 27.92%    9.899      1 Template:Icon_link\n 27.03%    9.582      1 Template:Ico